            <ArticleTitle>Idiopathic Fascicular Left Ventricular Tachycardia.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>83-87</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.4103/HEARTVIEWS.HEARTVIEWS_145_15</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Idiopathic left fascicular ventricular tachycardia (ILFVT) is characterized by right bundle branch block morphology and left axis deviation. We report a case of idiopathic left ventricular fascicular tachycardia in a young 31-year-old male patient presenting with a narrow complex tachycardia.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
